## Allowing setting type: unactivated when using collision-behavior: add on unsubscribed subscriber.

[`POST /v1/subscribers`](/api-subscribers-create) with `X-Buttondown-Collision-Behavior: add` will now respect passing `type: unactivated` and will send a confirmation email instead of going directly to `type: regular` when passing an unsubscribed email address.

See [Creating a subscriber](/api-subscribers-create#handling-collisions-and-updates) for the full `add` vs `overwrite` distinction.
